{"id":"wb-6-674","name":"洪江古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"洪江古建筑群","text":"洪江古建筑群位于中国湖南省怀化市洪江管理区，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n洪江古镇原属黔阳县，地处巫水与沅江交汇处，是明清时期湘西南和黔东地区土特产的主要运输中转站，现仍保存有明清至民国时期的大量古建筑如寺庙、钱庄、商号、洋行、作坊、店铺、客栈等共380多栋，总面积约20余万平方米\n，其中“国保”建筑18栋。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B4%AA%E6%B1%9F%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":84933340,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84933340","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9e259c8648cae205ed34f19a.jpg","title":"洪江古商城.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B4%AA%E6%B1%9F%E5%8F%A4%E5%95%86%E5%9F%8E.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/%E6%B4%AA%E6%B1%9F%E5%8F%A4%E5%95%86%E5%9F%8E.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Ninedyz","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​洪江古商城正门","width":320,"height":238}}